### Win Rate

The win rate can be calculated using:

```text
Win Rate = (Number of Wins / Total Games) × 100
```

For example, if MCTS wins 8 out of 20 games:

```text
Win Rate = (8 / 20) × 100
         = 40%
```

Use the **actual output from your program**, rather than assuming these example values.

